#====================================================================
# Draft knowledge entry - shadow CI isolated job dies at KC gate with
# 'permission denied: bash': hnp-bin missing from runner PATH surfaces
# at the gate layer (not just conan build), fix job-private env.sh
# Source: sysrqd/17 r1 (2026-10-01, job sysrqd-17-20261001)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-shadow-ci-kc-gate-permission-denied-bash-hnp-path
trigger_tool:           ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job|zsh|build_and_test.sh
phase:                  shadow-ci|ci-gate
error_signature:        build_and_test\.sh:[0-9]+: permission denied: bash|\[fail\] KC: knowledge check failed|blocked_by_KC

severity:               2
category:               shadow-ci|ci|ohos|toolchain
match_keywords:         permission denied: bash, KC, knowledge check failed, blocked_by_KC, knowledge_check.sh, hnp/bin/bash, isolated job, env.sh, runner PATH, run-conan-heavy, GNU bash 5.3, sysrqd

title:                  隔离 job runner PATH 缺 /data/service/hnp/bin 使 KC 门禁的 bash 调用被拒（L0 全过后挂 KC、blocked_by_KC 连锁）：job 私有 env.sh 追加 hnp bin 即修复

root_cause:             >
    ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job.sh 生成的 runner 只带 python-user/.local PATH，
    设备无 /bin/bash、/usr/bin/bash（仅 /bin/sh 与 zsh），GNU bash 5.3 在
    /data/service/hnp/bin/bash 且不在 runner PATH。build_and_test.sh 的 KC 步骤
    显式 bash ci/scripts/knowledge_check.sh，zsh 报 permission denied 判 KC fail，
    L1/L2/L4/L5 全部 blocked_by_KC。与 opencsg 条目同根因（hnp bin 缺 PATH）但
    失败面不同：opencsg 挂在 conan build() 的 cmake Error 127；本条挂在更早的
    KC 门禁层。conan profile [buildenv] 自带 hnp PATH，故 conan create 本身不受
    影响，问题只在 build_and_test.sh 的直接 bash 调用暴露。判据：同设备同批多个
    无关包同时挂同一门禁 = 环境级问题，不是当前包问题。

rec_approach:           job-env-path-append-hnp-bin
rec_description:        >
    修复 job 私有 env.sh（非 git 基础设施，一库一 PR 边界不被破坏）：追加
    export PATH=/data/service/hnp/bin:$PATH，重跑 run-conan-heavy.sh。修复一次
    后同 job 后续轮次不再复发。
rec_command:            echo 'export PATH=/data/service/hnp/bin:$PATH' >> "$JOB/env.sh"; . "$JOB/env.sh" && command -v bash && bash --version | head -1; sh "$JOB/run-conan-heavy.sh"
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               job-env-file

verification_cmd:       PATH="$OLD_PATH" command -v bash || echo NO_BASH_IN_PATH; ls /data/service/hnp/bin/bash
evidence:               |
    sysrqd/17 r1: L0 全 pass 后挂 KC（build_and_test.sh:980: permission denied: bash，
    L1-L5 全 blocked_by_KC）；同批 reniced r2 同样挂 KC。env.sh 追加 hnp bin 后
    r2 立即 KC1-KC5 全 OK，conan create 成功、test_package 6/6 PASS；r3 全绿
    （L0/L1/L4/L5 pass + L1e genuine）。

similar_to:             opencsg-1.8.2-shadow-ci-isolated-job-hnp-toolchain-path(同根因,build层cmake表现)|DRAFT-shadow-ci-isolated-conanhome-missing-ohpcd-remote
source_package:         sysrqd/17
status:                 UNMATCHED
